The ffmpeg and ffprobe in this image are jellyfin-ffmpeg's portable builds, unmodified, from
https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-ffmpeg/releases. They are licensed GPL-3.0-or-later; their
complete source is jellyfin-ffmpeg at the tag of the version this image installs, at
https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-ffmpeg, with the libraries its builder/ scripts name.
